uestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Adidas $ 11.11Adidas $ 11.11</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->3</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>When do we use \"struct\" keyword ?</span></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>To declare a structure</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Optionally for creating structure variables</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Both of the above</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList_